  "bodyHtml": "<p><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5163801\" target=\"_blank\">https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5163801</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"og-div\"><a href=\"https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=gov&amp;no=5163801\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"og-wrap\"><div class=\"og-img\" data-img=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96cc2c077c875fb00e25301a7306f8eaf36d82089bf84752ffdceff7ccab0b0ae4a5141\"><img class=\"og-img\" referrerpolicy=\"\" src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/001e7bec590625ddd89ef24ccd08df2b3d8fd2601d2cd46c2dfd4ff7f2cae21d.png\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"og-info\"><div class=\"og-inr\"><strong class=\"og-tit\">[챈펌] 유니온레이드 결산 시트   </strong><strong class=\"og-gallname\"> - 니케 마이너 갤러리</strong></div><p class=\"og-txt\">\n\n출처: [니케챈] 유니온 레이드 결산 관리 시트 v260414\nhttps://arca.라이브/b/nikketgv/161405505/883901062#c_883901062\n라이브 &amp;gt; live\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><p class=\"og-lnk\">gall.dcinside.com</p></div></a></div><p><br></p><p>챈펌 유니온 레이드 결산 시트 관련 Q&amp;A입니다.</p><p><br></p><p>1. TAMPERMONKEY 어디서 받아요?</p><p><br></p><p><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/tampermonkey/dhdgffkkebhmkfjojejmpbldmpobfkfo?hl=ko\" target=\"_blank\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/tampermonkey/dhdgffkkebhmkfjojejmpbldmpobfkfo?hl=ko</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"og-div\"><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/tampermonkey/dhdgffkkebhmkfjojejmpbldmpobfkfo?hl=ko\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"og-wrap\"><div class=\"og-img\" data-img=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/zoY8FwoOqPlBgFxcmFdNSK2Q4CcLmv-gw7vTjF2KMR9cEabwBsGNrHBTEMitn0Ba6OmCVJ0NcLnFGu3N97BP8Phu0g=s128-rj-sc0x00ffffff\"><img class=\"og-img\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/402336f7cfbbc7a79a49bedfa04358da7e46349a8564b8ccb3119c483d954f3a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"og-info\"><div class=\"og-inr\"><strong class=\"og-tit\">Tampermonkey - Chrome 웹 스토어 </strong></div><p class=\"og-txt\">Change the web at will with userscripts</p><p class=\"og-lnk\">chromewebstore.google.com</p></div></a></div><p><br></p><p>2. CSV 다운로드 버튼이 안떠요</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/4cd9588e5d2391c4cfc7e2ec3b7be05495e221e8129d5117fbf749691ef4c85b.png\" data-fileno=\"4053565\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c63f42a4995\"></p><p><br></p><p>이 경우엔 여러가지 원인이 있습니다</p><p><br></p><p>확장 프로그램 관리 입장</p><p><a>chrome://extensions/</a></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/9d6a75662acd34c691897300ea0c9ed011c440621bb14b9f4bfd767511c12e87.png\" data-fileno=\"4053568\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046544a9f4\"></p><p><br></p><p>개발자 모드 ON</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/40d3967a905f197253cb6d556bf7b17fd21fb43f8495d9c458801544253c88d5.png\" data-fileno=\"4053569\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c66f52b46\"></p><p><br></p><p>세부정보 입장</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/43a4721e1ae9a07464a3831ab0256ea42d7c42c6c29d875fff710e431968aae1.png\" data-fileno=\"4053570\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c63f32149\"></p><p><br></p><p>쭉 내리시고 사용자 스크립트 허용</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/c99ed3a463c4f11911233897b15ed63b136c54b65338b1860e13b869cac8531f.png\" data-fileno=\"4053567\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046ec94ccc\"></p><p>1 표기된 거 확인</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/c3b9e9bc05176c23c29d922140478ce55aa28af0dbe3ea6d5ca643dca4ae713e.png\" data-fileno=\"4053566\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c65f92f49\"></p><p><br></p><p>활성화 상태인지 체크</p><p><br></p><p>3. 유레 다른 회차 어떻게 입력해요?</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5192608/534b30cd0911cde51d425e3627d0ffc50f98d41031550768a8b82042e9303412.png\" data-fileno=\"4053571\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c66